# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) and fill it in. Vite only reads VITE_-prefixed variables,
# and only from this folder — the project's root local.env never reaches the React app.
#
# Same OAuth client id as GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in the project's local.env (Google Cloud Console >
# APIs & Services > Credentials, type "Web application", with this app's URL as an authorized
# JavaScript origin, e.g. http://localhost:5173 for `vite dev`). Empty = the Google button in
# Avisos says the feature isn't set up yet.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
